Daggers is not the answer. Daggers are great only till you have not
found the luckstone and then maxed your luck and then blessed and
enchanted your secret stash of darts. After that it is darts and
arrows all the way.

Daggers are way too heavy. Darts on the other hand are great, they
have a little less damage but you can have a hundred of them in your
pack at once.

What you noticed is correct once you have maxed your luck the
probability of an arrow or dart disappearing is 1 in 200. This is so
low that you can complete the whole game with 200 arrows or darts
provided you don't lose them any other way.

This means that you should untrap all dart traps. Racial arrows when
fired by racial bows are slightly better than darts if you have maxed
strength.  Arrows will be better if you are an Elf with no increased
strength.

Daggers maybe better but I say that leave them behind and use darts
instead there are enough in the traps in mines, for the whole game.
In addition darts can be poisoned.

